%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: Sparrow
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 11
  entries:
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: Pulsefire Cannons
    AbilityDescription: Full-auto cannons. Space extends their range dramatically
      - short at rest, unchanged at full overcharge. At level 5 shots pierce through
      prisms - both bullets and turret-stance prism rounds.
    Input: 1
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 9
    MinMultiplier: 0.4
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Piercing Bullets
    UpgradeDescription: Shots pierce through prisms instead of being destroyed on
      first impact - bullets and turret-stance prism rounds alike. SPACE owns REACH;
      the armour on fired prisms is MASS 5.
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Afterburner
    AbilityDescription: Hold to boost indefinitely - there is no heat and no meter.
      Boosting at full stick deflection performs one strafing roll per press (base,
      no unlock). Time raises the boost speed; at level 5 boosting also makes you
      immune to elemental debuffs.
    Input: 7
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1.5
    MinMultiplier: 0.5
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Elemental Ward
    UpgradeDescription: While boosting, elemental debuffs cannot land - danger prisms
      and skimmer overtakes leave your levels untouched. Buffs still apply.
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: Turret Stance
    AbilityDescription: Stop and fire prisms instead of bullets - the same shot in
      every way, except you watch a prism fly and it stays wherever the bullet would
      have died. Mass is the SUBSTANCE of what you fire: it stretches the fired prisms
      AND swells every round as it travels (3x over its flight at rest, 6x at level
      10), so the hit volume grows with the visual. At level 5 fired prisms arrive
      shielded.
    Input: 6
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 2.5
    MinMultiplier: 0.4
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Shielded Prisms
    UpgradeDescription: Prisms fired in the turret stance arrive shielded - one-hit
      ablative octahedron armor, with a wider hit sphere to match. Briefly lived at
      Space 5 (2026-08 round 4) and was returned here by design sign-off: MASS owns
      the substance of what you fire, SPACE owns its reach.
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Skyburst Rockets
    AbilityDescription: Crystal-stocked rockets that detonate on impact. Charge
      widens the blast radius (authored on the skyburst effect assets); at level
      5 the explosions spare your own domain.
    Input: 2
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1
    MinMultiplier: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Domain-Safe Skybursts
    UpgradeDescription: Skyburst explosions no longer destroy your own domain's
      prisms.
